ent DPS/Sub DPS, she’s one of the top fire DPSs and a very flexible one at that. She’s able to deal damage numbers greater than Modernia (previous best sub-DPS), more notably against targets without cores. She’s also competitive with Nikkes like Scarlet: Black Shadow and Rapi: Red Hood (B3)", "id": 162}, "tierlist2": null, "recommendations": null, "overloadrecs": null}